      "value": "<div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"454e62d4-9192-448b-b4ea-88f080549231\" data-macro-id=\"1c4475f2-6130-4259-942d-2616e3fc33ab\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p>We have EAV job in mart to get the attributes for Provider, Programs, Person, Visits and Operation Theatre. Also the identifier values for Patient. Below is the list of mart tables for the same.</p><h4 id=\"EAV(EntityAttributeValue)Job-1.ProviderAttributes\">1. Provider Attributes</h4><p><code>provider_attributes</code> table gives all the provider attribute information in an implementation.</p><p>Openmrs tables used: provider, provider_attribute, provider_attribute_type</p><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\" id=\"EAV(EntityAttributeValue)Job-ExistingOpenMRStables\"><strong>Existing OpenMRS tables</strong></h5><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"733df261-c18c-421a-a2e8-1ec406d60fa8\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">provider\nprovider_attribute\nprovider_attribute_type\n</pre>\n</div></div><p><strong>provider.json:</strong></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e8ee18a9-5e02-4761-9c10-71a6108278f5\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">{\n      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Provider Attributes&quot;,\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;eav&quot;,\n      &quot;tableName&quot;: &quot;provider_attributes&quot;,\n      &quot;eavAttributes&quot;: 